   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "My age",
     "texto": [
      "To say your age, the dative of the person + number + noun is used: **Мне двадцать пять лет**. With 1: **год**; with 2–4: **года**; with 5–20: **лет**. In compound numbers, look at the last two digits: if they end in 11–14, use **лет**; otherwise, decide by the last digit: **21 год, 22 года, 25 лет, 114 лет**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Congratulating",
     "texto": [
      "**Поздравлять** = to congratulate, and **с днём рождения** = happy birthday. You say **Поздравляю тебя с днём рождения** (I congratulate you on your birthday).",
      "In **с днём**, **днём** is the instrumental of **день**. **Это тебе подарок** = this is a gift for you.",
      "With **желать** (to wish), the person is in the dative and what is wished is in the genitive: **Я желаю тебе счастья** (I wish you happiness)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
